Hysteresis Logic: - SYNC $\to$ DEPHASE at $\theta \geq 0.8$.

DEPHASE $\to$ ISOLATED at $\theta > 1.2$.

ISOLATED $\to$ SYNC ONLY at $\theta < 0.7$ (The Solidus Line).

5. Implementation & Limits

5.1 Material Specifications

Structural Lattice: Ti-6Al-4V (Grade 5).

Damping Interface: Viton fluoroelastomer ($\eta < 0.05$).

Thermal Dissipation: Graphene composite interface ($\tau_d > 10^6$ s).

5.2 Operational Boundaries

Nyquist Limit ($\Delta t$): $1/(2f_c) \approx 0.45$ ps.

Quantum Bound ($I_{max}$): $I_u < 10^{34}$ bits (to avoid quantum tunneling through archival blocks).

Gravitational Bound ($m_{max}$): $m_{lag} < 1.2$ kg per local node (gravitational stability limit).

